{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_Logo.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_00.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robicon is a tactical tower defense game with roguelite elements. It features a retro-wave aesthetic inspired by vintage computing and synth-era visuals. Every mission is unique. Control your combat platform, place and merge specialized towers, build a defense strong enough to crush endless waves of robotic enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEPLOY YOUR DEFENSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the battlefield: position your towers, optimize your platform layout, and repel relentless waves of ruthless machines. Every wave pushes your tactics to the limit \u2014 adapt, upgrade, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_01.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MERGE. UPGRADE. DESTROY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect towers, merge them into advanced tech, and experiment with different builds. Discover rare, high-powered weapons designed for pure efficiency and total destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_02.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete missions to unlock new towers, platforms, and game-changing modifiers. The more you unlock, the more engaging each run becomes. With every victory, your arsenal grows \u2014 unlocking deeper strategy and more explosive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_03.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHALLENGE YOURSELF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into hostile regions, defeat elite bosses, and claim epic rewards as you fight your way toward the final level. What secrets \u2014 and threats \u2014 await you at the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_04.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_05.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639790?t=1744187534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639790?t=1744187534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/bf92e73e9723189a2861df8b52b44df827305ef8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744187534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/bf92e73e9723189a2861df8b52b44df827305ef8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744187534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_Logo.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639790/extras/Robicon_Gif_00.gif?t=1744187534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_parag